doc:Factspaper1_4 schema1:abstract "This paper presents an integrated numerical and experimental methodology for processbased condition monitoring, early-stage fault detection, and diagnosis to improve the operational safety and structural integrity of remotely operated working machines." .
_:c600557c5ee9d013b1934e5fec37f8b8 rdf:reifies <<( doc:Factspaper1_4 schema1:abstract "This paper presents an integrated numerical and experimental methodology for processbased condition monitoring, early-stage fault detection, and diagnosis to improve the operational safety and structural integrity of remotely operated working machines." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:167ca8a63a3a .
doc:Factspaper1_4 schema1:abstract "The approach integrates numerical strength simulations with sensor data collected during operation, correlating process signals with complex loading scenarios and hazard states." .
